flowchart TD
  A["restore.sh checks every file<br/>against SHA256SUMS"] --> B["Says what it will do;<br/>run again with --yes"]
  B --> C["Restores into kilnmark_restoring<br/>while Kilnmark keeps running"]
  C --> D{"Restored?"}
  D -- no --> X(["Nothing has changed:<br/>Kilnmark runs as before"])
  D -- yes --> E["Stops Kilnmark; keeps its database<br/>as kilnmark_before_&lt;time&gt;"]
  E --> F["Puts the restored database<br/>in place as kilnmark"]
  F --> G["Swaps the keys, keeping the old ones<br/>in before-restore-&lt;time&gt;"]
  G --> H["Starts Kilnmark and waits<br/>until it is ready"]
  H --> I(["Audit log: Database restored.<br/>Redo security changes made since the backup"])
